  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">那么，你喜欢玩僵尸末日题材的游戏吗？当你试图在一群变异僵尸的围攻下求生时，会发生什么？你生存的时间越长，它们就会变得越强！因此，这个整合包就是专为这种生存体验而设计的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">特色功能：</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">- 血月事件每晚都会发生。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">- 在火车上求生。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">- 抵御成群的僵尸及其变种僵尸。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">- 添加新的枪械、武器和工具，以提升生存体验。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">该整合包是专门为自定义地图创建的，可在“勒奇喵爱发电”下载：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.net%252fa%252fleqimiao\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://afdian.net/a/leqimiao</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">但您也可以在不使用自定义地图的情况下使用它！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">关于火车主题的视频也可以在我的哔哩哔哩（Bilibili）主页上找到。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">您可以在哔哩哔哩上找到我的视频。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fb23.tv%252fv2vy9iS\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://b23.tv/v2vy9iS</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">注意：英文翻译纯属机器翻译。Optifine 需要手动下载。下载完成后，只需将 .jar 文件复制到此特定实例的 Mods 文件夹中即可。</span></p>",
